            "text_1_body": "I like that Zeotein brings protein and collagen together in one easy serving. It makes my daily shake feel simple and intentional, without adding a lot of steps to my routine.”",
            "text_1_name": "Casey M.",
            "text_2_stars": 5,
            "text_2_title": "Convenient nutrition, without the fuss",
            "text_2_body": "Having 23g of protein in a cacao shake makes it easy to fit into my day. I can mix it with milk or blend it into a smoothie, depending on what I’m in the mood for.",
            "text_2_name": "Alexa S.",
            "text_3_stars": 5,
            "text_3_title": "A routine I can keep up with",
